The following text is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the senior accountant in your department. 
When sending to the senior accountant in your department is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
After creating a receiving report, the next tasks should be reporting errors to relevant team member and gathering the vendors invoice, they should be done in parallel. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then scheduling the payment should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process, which begins with the sending to the senior accountant in your department.
When a sms to the senior accountant in your department is completed, creating a sms report should be done.
After creating a receiving report the next task should be reporting the errors to the relevant team member and collecting the vendor invoice. These should be done in parallel.
Once all the pre-tasks have been completed the payment should be scheduled.
The process is now concluded.
"
